OL,3,GNEWSAFuel duty proposal withdrawn after
OL,4,Adiscussions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to reduce fuel duty for three
OL,7,Fmonths to help motorists deal with the
OL,8,Fcost of living crisis has been
OL,9,Fwithdrawn.
OL,11,FDeputy Lucy Stephenson put forward her
OL,12,Fproposition to Jersey's States Assembly
OL,13,Fin June which called for the tax -
OL,14,Fcurrently around the 65p per litre mark
OL,15,F- added to petrol and diesel prices to
OL,16,Fbe cut by 10p a litre from 1 October to
OL,17,F31 December.
OL,19,FHowever, Stephenson said she had
OL,20,Fwithdrawn the proposal following
OL,21,F"constructive discussions" with
OL,22,FTreasury Minister Alan Maclean.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
